{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A Tile-placer\u00a0Roguelike. Build your board, empower yourself and slay monsters.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carve your paths through the mysterious Shrouded Abyss and use Runic Tiles to destroy the strange creatures from the lands beyond the mountain.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/cc83c44288c6c5a76d6a514205afcf4e.poster.avif?t=1768247450\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/cc83c44288c6c5a76d6a514205afcf4e.webm?t=1768247450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/cc83c44288c6c5a76d6a514205afcf4e.mp4?t=1768247450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Place tiles of various shapes on the board to create a path across, and attack your enemies through the routes you create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Discover a variety of skill, artifacts and equipment to shape your character and descend into the deepest layers of the Abyss, where your survival depends solely on your strategic prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Each run brings new skills to discover, new foes to face and new strategies to develop. Will you survive or succumb to the Shrouded Abyss? <br> <br><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through three somber areas and face each of their gatekeepers\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 70+ forgotten artifacts and pieces of equipment to mold your character and playstyle to your liking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn over 60 arcane skills and cast them to hinder your enemies or manipulate the board as you please</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters and starting skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006200?t=1768247450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/4412a4aedfc89de08bffdf1d26f070b4daad99ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768247450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/d46888f8b3f33a1798632fc9a783bc7b6af8e36d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768247450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/d46888f8b3f33a1798632fc9a783bc7b6af8e36d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768247450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4095110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A Tile-placer\u00a0Roguelike. Build your board, empower yourself and slay monsters.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carve your paths through the mysterious Shrouded Abyss and use Runic Tiles to destroy the strange creatures from the lands beyond the mountain.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/cc83c44288c6c5a76d6a514205afcf4e.poster.avif?t=1768247450\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/cc83c44288c6c5a76d6a514205afcf4e.webm?t=1768247450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/extras/cc83c44288c6c5a76d6a514205afcf4e.mp4?t=1768247450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Place tiles of various shapes on the board to create a path across, and attack your enemies through the routes you create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Discover a variety of skill, artifacts and equipment to shape your character and descend into the deepest layers of the Abyss, where your survival depends solely on your strategic prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Each run brings new skills to discover, new foes to face and new strategies to develop. Will you survive or succumb to the Shrouded Abyss? <br> <br><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through three somber areas and face each of their gatekeepers\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 70+ forgotten artifacts and pieces of equipment to mold your character and playstyle to your liking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn over 60 arcane skills and cast them to hinder your enemies or manipulate the board as you please</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters and starting skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mattalarc & Wolter"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006200/444d215fcf4c76da709405670e75064ba53b97fe/header.jpg?t=1768247450","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4006200/474330051/9add994d5e88071d761761ae9f06d5ead35e35bc/1763447762/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763448448","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4006200/474330051/9add994d5e88071d761761ae9f06d5ead35e35bc/1763447762/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763448448","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4006200/474330051/9add994d5e88071d761761ae9f06d5ead35e35bc/1763447762/hls_264_m